{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "d5c24d12-0024-450e-92ca-c25a9d2e7f4d",
      "name": "custom-list-record",
      "description": {
        "content": "Endpoints to add, update, delete and get custom list records.\n\nCustom Lists can be used in two ways:\n- Custom Lists can be used to screen persons and transactions against them in the same way it works for Dow Jones\nlists. For example, if a client has some in-house black list, it can be added to screening as custom list.\n- Custom Lists can be referenced in monitoring scenarios. For example, a scenario may trigger when the transaction\namount is higher than some threshold and the recipient country is in custom list of high risk countries.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
